    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Since we have `pre/post_install` hooks, I think it would be useful to have a hook that run before/after removing the package. The usecase is that one might need to cleanup the stuff that was added in the install hook ([example](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/discussions/1387#discussion-7627836)).",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Since we have <code class=\"notranslate\">pre/post_install</code> hooks, I think it would be useful to have a hook that run before/after removing the package. The usecase is that one might need to cleanup the stuff that was added in the install hook (<a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/discussions/1387#discussion-7627836\" data-hovercard-type=\"discussion\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1387/hovercard\">example</a>).</p>",
    "bodyText": "Since we have pre/post_install hooks, I think it would be useful to have a hook that run before/after removing the package. The usecase is that one might need to cleanup the stuff that was added in the install hook (example).",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
