                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "> The plugins don't need to be loaded.\r\n\r\nThey need to be loaded in a sense that the only way to define hooks (including potential \"remove\" hooks) is inside `add()`, which adds and loads a plugin.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The plugins don't need to be loaded.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">They need to be loaded in a sense that the only way to define hooks (including potential \"remove\" hooks) is inside <code class=\"notranslate\">add()</code>, which adds and loads a plugin.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "The plugins don't need to be loaded.\n\nThey need to be loaded in a sense that the only way to define hooks (including potential \"remove\" hooks) is inside add(), which adds and loads a plugin.",
